# shadcn/ui primitives live here

This directory is the single source of truth for shadcn/ui primitives shared by
`apps/web` and `apps/admin` (see Requirement 13.2).

Add primitives with the shadcn CLI from the package root (`packages/ui`), e.g.:

    bunx shadcn@latest add button

Each primitive imports the shared `cn` helper from `@rgss/ui/lib/utils` and is
re-exported from `packages/ui/src/index.ts` so consumers can do:

    import { Button } from '@rgss/ui'

No primitives existed in `apps/web/src/components/ui` at migration time (only a
`.gitkeep`); this package is therefore established as the source of truth so all
future primitives land here once and are consumed by both apps.
